guide forever/reputation/timbermaw-hold
title Timbermaw Hold Reputation
category Reputation
levels 48-60
zone Felwood
# Built from the Era-baseline reference data: Grazle, Nafien and Salfa and
# their quests (8460 Timbermaw Ally, 8462 Speak to Nafien, 8461 Deadwood of the
# North, 8465 Speak to Salfa, 8464 Winterfall Activity), the repeatable
# turn-ins they unlock (8466 Feathers for Grazle, 8467 Feathers for Nafien,
# 8469 Beads for Salfa) and the Deadwood Headdress Feather / Winterfall Spirit
# Beads drop tables. Farm spots are the densest spawn clusters of the droppers.
# Nothing public shows Forever changing Felwood or Winterspring; this has NOT
# been play-tested on Forever yet.
#
# The feather and bead turn-ins are repeatable and the client never flags them
# completed, so those steps track the Timbermaw Hold standing (rep 576). Five
# feathers or beads per turn-in is game knowledge, not data. The data lists
# Grazle at two spots in Felwood; he is pinned to the southern one (by the
# Emerald Sanctuary, as Timbermaw Ally's text says). The starting standing is
# the Forever client's (Faction 576 ReputationBase -3500: Hostile, 2500/3000).
# At Hostile the furbolgs in the tunnels attack; the Felwood quests and kills
# usually bring a player to Unfriendly, when they let you pass
# (https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-classic/timbermaw-hold-reputation-farming-guide).

step Grazle
  tip Timbermaw Hold starts out Hostile, and its furbolgs in the tunnels attack until you reach Unfriendly. Every Deadwood and Winterfall furbolg you kill raises it, so the quests below pay twice. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains.
  accept 8460 @50.9,85

step Deadwood Village
  tip Deadwood furbolgs (level 48-50) camp at the southern end of Felwood. Keep every Deadwood Headdress Feather they drop: Grazle and Nafien take them later.
  kill 7153 quest 8460.1 @48.2,91.2
  kill 7155 quest 8460.2 @48.4,91.4
  kill 7154 quest 8460.3 @48.1,90.3

step Back to Grazle
  turnin 8460 @50.9,85
  accept 8462 @50.9,85

step Nafien
  tip Nafien waits in northern Felwood at the tunnel into Timbermaw Hold.
  turnin 8462 @64.8,8.1
  accept 8461 @64.8,8.1

step Deadwood of the North
  tip The northern Deadwood (level 53-55) hold the camps just south of the tunnel. Keep their feathers too.
  kill 7156 quest 8461.1 @62.2,9
  kill 7157 quest 8461.2 @62.2,9
  kill 7158 quest 8461.3 @62.2,9

step Back to Nafien
  turnin 8461 @64.8,8.1
  accept 8465 @64.8,8.1

step Salfa
  zone Winterspring
  tip Go through Timbermaw Hold to its Winterspring exit; Salfa stands just outside. The quests and kills so far usually reach Unfriendly, and then the Timbermaw let you pass. If they still show red, kill more Deadwood by the tunnel first.
  turnin 8465 @27.7,34.5
  accept 8464 @27.7,34.5

step Winterfall Village
  tip Winterfall Village sits on the eastern side of Winterspring. Keep every Winterfall Spirit Beads you loot: Salfa takes them.
  kill 7439 quest 8464.1
  kill 7440 quest 8464.2 @67.3,35.3
  kill 7438 quest 8464.3 @67.9,37.9

step Back to Salfa
  turnin 8464 @27.7,34.5

step Feathers and beads to Friendly
  tip Feathers for Grazle and Feathers for Nafien (Deadwood Headdress Feathers) and Beads for Salfa (Winterfall Spirit Beads) repeat as often as you like; every Deadwood or Winterfall kill counts as well. Winterfall Village is the densest bead spot.
  collect 21383 x5 optional @67.1,37.6
  talk 11556 optional -- Salfa: Beads for Salfa
  rep 576 Friendly

step Feathers to Honored
  zone Felwood
  tip The northern Deadwood camps by the tunnel are the densest feather spot (35% drop chance there). Hand feathers to Nafien at the tunnel, or to Grazle in the south.
  collect 21377 x5 optional @62.2,9
  talk 15395 optional -- Nafien: Feathers for Nafien
  rep 576 Honored

step Timbermaw Hold to Revered
  tip Alternate Deadwood feathers (Nafien) and Winterfall beads (Salfa), whichever camp is less crowded.
  collect 21377 x5 optional @62.2,9
  talk 15395 optional
  rep 576 Revered

step Timbermaw Hold to Exalted
  tip Keep turning in feathers and beads until Exalted.
  collect 21377 x5 optional @62.2,9
  talk 15395 optional
  rep 576 Exalted
